        "created_at": "2014-08-13T03:30:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have no idea of anyone on this board is signed up for my Sentinels Storyline Event on Friday night at Gen Con.</p><p>If any of you are, I look forward to seeing you there. I'll do my best to make it as fun for you as I can.</p><p>For anyone else going to Gen Con. Have a safe trip, and I hope to cross paths with you there and maybe get a game in.</p>",
